Package: deliberately
Title: Evidence-Linked Audits of Deliberative Processes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", email = "gsood07@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Validate deliberative polling data and produce modular diagnostics
    of sampling, participation, deliberative exchange, and outcomes. Explicit
    input requirements, researcher-defined contrasts and policies, and evidence
    provenance distinguish unavailable measurements from observed results.
    Implements signed attitude movement measures described by Luskin et al.
    (2022) <doi:10.1017/S0007123421000168>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
URL: https://finite-sample.github.io/dp-deliberately/, https://github.com/finite-sample/dp-deliberately
BugReports: https://github.com/finite-sample/dp-deliberately/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: assertr, cli, digest, dplyr (>= 1.1.1), readr, rlang, tibble, withr,
    randomizr
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), roxygen2, lintr, rmarkdown, knitr, pkgload,
    survey, clubSandwich, pkgdown, ggplot2, gt, DT, bslib, htmltools,
    covr, spelling, yaml, rprojroot, rcmdcheck
